--- !u!114 &471591043
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 471591042}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Enforcer
    text: Channel's supposed to be dead down here. Who's moving?
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: The collateral I tracked this morning. Same cage. Your records are still
      past it.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: If you're buyers, the auction's two tiers up. If you're something else,
      get it over with.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: The tag says Iris.
    seconds: 2.5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Say that again. Say the name again.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: ...Who is that. Who's on the channel.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Iris. It's your father. I've been scraping a dead field for six years to
      buy you back.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: They told me you stopped looking. They told me you signed me away.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: They lied. I never stopped. Not one night. I'm right above you.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Hold still. I'm cutting you loose.
    seconds: 2.5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: You're the one he came with. The operative. He's really up there.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: He never sat down. Go to him.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: I read systems. Locks, networks, the paper they keep on people. Take me
      to that vault.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: She's right. I can get you to the door. Getting through it is a different
      trade.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Iris. Stay between them. You come back up to me. You hear?
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: I hear you. I'm coming back. Let me earn the trip first.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  textMesh: {fileID: 382967191}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 2008664219}
  audioSource: {fileID: 471591044}
